OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe clear spells at first in the
OL,7,Fnorthwest. Otherwise largely cloudy
OL,8,Fthrough the evening and overnight with
OL,9,Fa few outbreaks of patchy light rain.
OL,10,FA milder night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FLargely cloudy and unsettled
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of rain, mostly light
OL,14,Fat first but becoming heavier and more
OL,15,Fpersistent through the day. Breezy
OL,16,Faround the coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
